Z||000000||Homicidal||06-27-2000||03:31 AM||||My dad.....this is too funny!<P>I told him I was going to wash my car, and I asked when dinner is going up.  He said "soon, so you got around 30 mins to wash your car!"<P>AAAAAAAAAHAHAH!<P>Poor naive father, he really doesn't love his car.  <P>30 mins?  What does he think, I own a Civic??  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>I spent 3 hours detailing my car!  When I say "wash the car", it never is half hour job!  How much time do you guys spend pampering your baby?||||reg||1
Z||000001||Haze_Performance||06-27-2000||04:13 AM||||Hmmmm..Lets see..3sec to roll down the windows,6sec to reach 45mph....and 1sec to drive through a big a$$ puddle. Yea 10sec should do it.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Oh but if its raining its 2 1/2sec to roll down windows(they move a 1/2 a sec faster when already wet  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ),8sec to remove sunroof, & 9sec to reach 45mph (I had to compensate for tire spin on wet asphalt) so its between 10 & 19 1/2sec to wash my baby.Im sure I could knock off 1/3 of a sec if I used premium gas. Ill try today and let you guys know.   ||||reg||14
