Z||000006||Oreif||06-27-2000||01:39 PM||||I used to work for a company back in my high school days that delivered cleaning supplies. We use to deliver soap to car wash places. We had a 5 gallon can that got banged when we took it off the truck. We noticed it started leaking. By the time (maybe a minute) we grabbed something to wipe it up, the soap ATE into the cement floor about 1/16" ! I read the lable and it says to mix 10 ounces to 2000 gallons! From that moment on I have never went to a car wash again. If the machine that dispenses the soap goes bad you won't have to worry about stripping the paint off to repaint it!||||reg||4
